\fs20 \cf0 \'93C\'92est de l\'92Art\'94 is a non-profit association formed by Fr\'e9d\'e9ric Durieu in 2009. Civil engineer in computer science, Fr\'e9d\'e9ric began his professional life as a multimedia developer in Brussels, Belgium. With his company Magic Media, he released a few award winning titles produced for prestigious customers like \'93La reunion des mus\'e9es de France\'94, famous French publishing houses like Gallimard or Hachette and international customers like the Japanese TV network NHK. Little by little, he became known for more artistic projects (algorithmic poetry) and made installations or online applications for Nike, Coke or IBM, for instance. His work has been exhibited in Paris, New York, Seoul and Tokyo and he receives several awards like the \'93Prix des nouvelles \'e9critures\'94 of the SACD (Soci\'e9t\'e9 des auteurs et compositeurs dramatiques), the \'93Grand Prix\'94 of the SCAM (Soci\'e9t\'e9 Civile des Auteurs Multim\'e9dia) and the \'93Grand Prix Moebius International\'94.\
\pard\pardeftab708\ri-386

